# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the Vell, new in era 4
@faction vell
name: The Vell families
about: Off the trains from the Vellmark in the last four years. The Row by the race, ten houses, rent paid weekly in cash.
start: 0
tier: -3 thinks you are the sign
tier: 0 does not trust you
tier: 2 trusts you, a little

