# ---------------------------------------------------------------- people new in era 4
@char e4.ruth_c
name: Ruth Furrowe, Halvard's auditor
speaker: RUTH
faction: district
about: Thirty-eight. Pell's daughter, Nan's mother. Flat shoes, a calculator in a leather case, a cold she has had since September.

@char e4.ann_c
name: Constable Ann Brack
speaker: ANN
faction: district
about: Thirty. Davey's daughter. Grew up two streets from the mill gate and went to school with half the picket.

@char e4.joss
name: Joss Haldane, mill foreman
speaker: JOSS
faction: hesh
about: Twenty-eight. Anni's grandson. Foreman on the second floor. Calls himself Tarn when it helps and Hesh when it helps more.

@char e4.kasem
name: Kasem Saro
speaker: KASEM
faction: vell
about: Thirty. From the Vellmark. Was a lathe-turner in a works that is a crater now. Smiles when he does not understand, which is often.

@char e4.mira
name: Mira Saro
speaker: MIRA
faction: vell
about: Twenty-seven, and sixty in year 103. Kasem's wife. Learns Tarnish off the labels in the shop. Laughs with her whole face.

@char e4.teo
name: Teo Saro
speaker: TEO
faction: vell
about: Four. Wants to hold the birdcage. Is never allowed.

@char e4.anzo
name: Anzo Velek
speaker: ANZO
faction: vell
about: Sixty. Mira's father. Carried an empty birdcage across three borders with the tea glasses packed in its straw.

@char e4.lew
name: Lew Haldane
speaker: LEW
faction: hesh
about: Twenty-four. Joss's younger brother. Hurt his back on the hoist two winters ago and has been on the clinic's tablets since.

@char e4.june
name: June Haldane
speaker: JUNE
faction: district
about: Twenty-two. Lew's wife, Tarn, from the estate. Kev is one.

@char e4.col
name: Col Haldane
speaker: COL
faction: district
about: Eighteen. Aaron's grandson. Calls himself Tarn. Sells the clinic's tablets on the stairs of the far-bank estate.

@char e4.dale
name: Dale Gedge
speaker: DALE
faction: district
about: Twenty-four. Constable Gedge's grandson. Three years on the mill's books as casual. Good with his hands, and paints.

@char e4.victor
name: Victor Orme
speaker: VICTOR
faction: district
about: Fifty. Chairman of the bank and owner of the mill. His great-grandfather's name is over the gate.

@char e4.sell
name: Arvid Sell, of Halvard
speaker: SELL
faction: district
about: Forty-eight. Halvard's regional man, from the Sund. Has closed nine mills and remembers all of them.

@char e4.irene
name: Irene Mott, records clerk
speaker: IRENE
faction: district
about: Forty-five. Walter's granddaughter. Takes the minute in shorthand and types it the same night.

@char e4.paul
name: Paul Ashby, of the campaign office
speaker: PAUL
faction: district
about: Thirty-five. Writes the posters and the Gazette's statements, sometimes the same afternoon.

@char e4.hal
name: Dr Hal Lind, the mill clinic
speaker: HAL
faction: district
about: Forty-five. Clara Lind's grandson. Has written the estate's scripts for six years and knows where they end up.

@char e4.sefa
name: Sefa Tesk the younger
speaker: SEFA
faction: hesh
about: Twenty. Keeps the door of the rebuilt Well House. Named for a great-uncle.

@char e4.danil
name: Danil Saro
speaker: DANIL
faction: vell
about: Five, in year 103. Teo's boy. Repeats any new word twice to keep it.

@char e4.nan
name: Nan Furrowe
speaker: NAN
faction: district
about: Thirteen. Ruth's daughter. Doing her homework at her grandad's table.

@char e4.rudd
name: Sergeant Rudd
speaker: RUDD
faction: district
about: Fifty-five. The desk sergeant. Has a word for every fire, and the word is always the same.

@char e4.gary
name: Gary Peel
speaker: GARY
faction: district
about: Twenty-two. A mill hand. Sings when he has had three.

